-- Demo data for three kecamatan in South Jakarta: Setiabudi, Mampang
-- Prapatan, and Tebet, built on real places. The 50,000 generated places for
-- load testing are in cmd/seed-bulk.
--
-- Place names, coordinates, addresses, opening hours, and most attributes come
-- from OpenStreetMap where it has them (© OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL),
-- fetched in November 2026 and assigned to a kecamatan by its OSM boundary. Hospitals, puskesmas,
-- and police stations were checked against their own sites, Kemenkes and BPJS
-- lists, and news reports. The kecamatan text is researched too.
--
-- Everything else is made up to make the demo look lived in: addresses (the
-- nearest street from a real neighbor, with an invented number), opening hours,
-- price ranges, short descriptions, optional attributes, and required
-- attributes OSM does not record (such as halal, BPJS for clinics, and laundry
-- turnaround). The 24 water and gas refills are fictional, placed near real
-- warung, mosques, and minimarkets, and so are all users and reviews.
--
-- Estimated daily spending excludes rent: three cheap meals (Rp15,000-25,000
-- each at a warteg or warung), drinking water, and transit (TransJakarta
-- Rp3,500, or at most Rp10,000 when combined with MRT and LRT within three
-- hours), plus an ojek ride. It is higher in Setiabudi, where meals near the
-- offices cost more.
INSERT INTO SUB_DISTRICTS (
    name,
    slug,
    flood_history,
    safety_crime_information,
    estimated_daily_spending
)
VALUES
    (
        'Setiabudi',
        'setiabudi',
        'Most of Setiabudi drains well, but intense rain leaves pools of about 10-30 cm on main roads such as Jl. Prof. Dr. Satrio, Jl. H.R. Rasuna Said, Jl. Gatot Subroto, and Jl. Sudirman, as in December 2019, January 2020, and July 2025. These usually clear within hours but slow traffic and TransJakarta Corridor 6. The kelurahan''s own disaster profile lists flood-prone pockets in Pasar Manggis, around Jl. Guntur, Jl. Burangrang, Jl. Minangkabau, and Jl. Sultan Agung.',
        'The office districts along Sudirman, Rasuna Said, and Gatot Subroto are busy, well lit, and guarded. Motorcycle theft and snatch theft (jambret) are the crimes most often reported, so use a second lock, park in guarded areas, and keep your phone away from the roadside. Polsek Metro Setiabudi on Jl. Taman Setiabudi is open 24 hours.',
        120000.00
    ),
    (
        'Mampang Prapatan',
        'mampang-prapatan',
        'One of the more flood-prone kecamatan in South Jakarta. Kali Krukut and Kali Mampang overflow after heavy rain, flooding Pela Mampang (including Komplek Polri Pondok Karya) and Bangka around Kemang most often. In October 2022, 13 RTs in Pela Mampang stood in up to 1 m of water; Jl. Kemang Raya flooded to about 30 cm in April 2024; and the January 2020 floods reached 1.5-2 m in parts of Kemang. Check the street before renting near either river.',
        'Mostly residential, with busy commercial strips on Jl. Mampang Prapatan Raya, Jl. Kapten Tendean, and the Kemang nightlife area. Motorcycle theft is the crime most often reported, so use a disc lock and guarded parking. Kemang stays busy late; take app-based transport rather than walking dark side streets. Polsek Metro Mampang Prapatan on Jl. Kapten Tendean is open 24 hours.',
        100000.00
    ),
    (
        'Tebet',
        'tebet',
        'Flooding is concentrated along the Ciliwung in Bukit Duri, Kebon Baru, and Manggarai, where riverbank RTs flood when water from Bogor arrives, typically 6-9 hours after the Katulampa weir or the Depok post goes on alert (as in March and October 2025). Water usually reaches 20-80 cm there, and more in major floods such as January 2020. Areas away from the river, such as most of Tebet Barat and Tebet Timur, are much less affected.',
        'Lively food streets around Jl. Tebet Raya and Tebet Timur Dalam stay busy into the night. Police patrol against street robbery (begal) and motorcycle theft at known spots such as Jl. Prof. Dr. Soepomo, Jl. Dr. Saharjo, and around Stasiun Tebet. Brawls (tawuran) break out from time to time near Stasiun Manggarai, so avoid lingering there late at night. Polsek Metro Tebet on Jl. Prof. Dr. Soepomo is open 24 hours.',
        100000.00
    )
ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;

